<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-10-14T17:24:47.028Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 17:24:47 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian federal forces have entered the strategic Tigray town of Adwa near the Eritrean border and now control the regional airport, while a pro-government militia also reports seizing the airport. Ethiopian drones have struck Eritrean troops that crossed into Ethiopian territory to support Tigrayan rebels. Heavy weapons are being moved toward the Eritrean border by Ethiopian forces, and the United Nations has allocated $8.5 million for humanitarian response as the conflict escalates in northern Ethiopia. Ethiopia and Somaliland are discussing defense cooperation, and Ethiopia targets a 70.3% reduction in greenhouse gas emissions by 2035. The war caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxQb2FQTWlGMzdwSWxvMmdvRDNvc290Qkk2bnpjbkxIaU5UZUVrXzZPbWgzR3JuQ2dPOXkyYlk1VjhMNl8teWJ3aE41UFFLS0pnYlB1ZGEwS0lPYzJYcWRkVjZwdkw3NEgtUXFwZm5jdDd3cXVxdlZCMnEwTDNway1tZmZtMXhjWFl0RmtOTlFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPS2xYb3JZZjd5V0VSaTNTNUlIQ3haLUZjdDhXSllpU3Z6VTg0SkVIUjkwRWJNZ0o2aXZtQTNxSUdHX0VpNUFaMlphS1lkNGZ2X1I0VzVYNUhRMFlhTUVYM3FGQkR5UTkxWmFVREhyZ1dMNTYwQmZmeGhZa3BpQ3FYbWEyTy1HdHNSdEE3UnBWdW45WmFyTm5jYVJjUng?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiS0FVX3lxTE5HUGhqbHpRd0poZ1FuY0NQNHVHYlc0S3Y4Rzh5ejJfWDFYbG5Ja1V6TnhFdEg3bUkzRVN6YnkxckVNVmc0UGczVjdWVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;AFP.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTFByaDdUNi1yRWhoS29STDBLLV9rLVh3MmN0QmNfODZmZXlwQ3ZKcmRuVF9jbmxtVmhjMVUxOGMxTFNKdzAtYlp1dTEtRkZNc0lCbVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Addis Standard&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE02VkRfaHlYWmVKVnl6UXFVOXF6Unp3LTlFR25WamRELVQ